{# roomhive/host/payouts.html.twig
   Host › Payouts — 1:1 port of legacy host/payouts.php.

   Stat pills (top-right of the page header): Available (wallet),
   Pending (hourglass), Paid Out (banknote) — same pillbox markup
   the other host pages use.

   Request-a-Payout card: amount (min ₱500, capped at the floor of
   the available balance) + payout method select (GCash / PayMaya /
   Bank Transfer) + REQUEST PAYOUT. The form posts back to this
   same route (PRG) and carries the session's pay_csrf token in
   the hidden field — legacy money-moving POST, CSRF-guarded.

   Payout History card: Requested / Method / Status / Amount
   table, or the two legacy empty states ("Payouts table not
   created yet — run the CREATE TABLE SQL in phpMyAdmin first."
   / "No payouts yet").

   PAYOUT FIX + RECEIPT (user request — pairs with the fixed
   HostPayoutsController):
   - 700 kept erroring because the controller's earnings query
     died on missing bookings columns → Available showed ₱0.00;
     the fixed controller now schema-detects exactly like the
     Earnings page, so the balance is real again.
   - The payouts table is AUTO-CREATED/REPAIRED by the controller
     (CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS + column repair) — the phpMyAdmin
     step is gone; the "not created yet" empty state only shows if
     even that fails.
   - A validated request is processed INSTANTLY: status
     'completed', processed_at set, the amount is gone from the
     Available pill on the redirect, and the row is recorded in
     Payout History.
   - The green RECEIPT box below renders once after a successful
     payout: PAYOUT SUCCESSFUL + reference HP-000xxx + amount,
     method, processed date · time, Completed pill and the NEW
     AVAILABLE BALANCE (consumed from the session, one render).

   CSS NOTE: hp-form-* / hp-input / hp-select / hp-link-view-all /
   hp-table / hp-status-* came from legacy hostprofile.css, which
   the Symfony shell does not ship — redeclared page-locally with
   the same values the other ported host pages standardized on
   (same approach as host/pending-tenants.html.twig's
   hp-btn-primary and host/earnings.html.twig's hp-table).

   ICON SUBSTITUTIONS — same mapping rule as host/bookings.html.twig
   (the macros file uses the older lucide.dev names the rest of
   the shell standardized on):
     legacy `wallet`    → macro 'wallet'    (exists)
     legacy `hourglass` → macro 'clock'     (Pending pill; same
                           substitution bookings uses)
     legacy `banknote`  → macro 'banknote'  (exists)
   No page-level lucide loader needed — the shared navbar ships
   the guarded loader.

   Pairs with: HostPayoutsController
     GET|POST /host/payouts   name app_host_payouts
#}
{% extends 'host/base.html.twig' %}
{% import 'admin/_macros.html.twig' as ui %}

{% set active_nav = 'payouts' %}

{% block page_title %}Payouts — RoomHive{% endblock %}

{% block styles %}
<style>
    /* ---- Page header (same values as the other host pages) ---- */
    .hp-page-header {
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .hp-page-title { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--rh-ink); }
    .hp-page-subtitle { margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: var(--rh-muted); max-width: 680px; }

    /* ---- Stat pillbox (top-right of the page header) ---- */
    .hp-stat-pillbox {
        display: flex; align-items: stretch; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .hp-stat-pill-item {
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
        background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--rh-line);
        border-radius: 12px; padding: 10px 14px;
        min-width: 130px;
    }
    .hp-stat-pill-icon {
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 8px;
        background: #F0F1F6; flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .hp-stat-pill-icon svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; color: #5d6875; }
    .hp-stat-pill-icon.hp-yellow svg { color: #C77A00; }
    .hp-stat-pill-icon.hp-green svg  { color: #1FA971; }
    .hp-stat-pill-label {
        margin: 0; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--rh-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em;
    }
    .hp-stat-pill-value {
        margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--rh-ink); line-height: 1.2;
    }

    /* ---- Flash messages (legacy hp-flash-*) ---- */
    .hp-flash {
        margin: 0 0 14px; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 10px;
        font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
    }
    .hp-flash-success { background: #E7F7EC; color: #1E7A3D; border: 1px solid #BFE8CF; }
    .hp-flash-error   { background: #FCEAEA; color: #C4302F; border: 1px solid #F3B9B9; }

    /* ---- Receipt box (result of the last successful payout) ---- */
    .hp-receipt {
        margin: 0 0 18px; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid #BFE8CF; background: #fff;
    }
    .hp-receipt-top {
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;
        background: #E7F7EC; border-bottom: 1px dashed #BFE8CF;
        padding: 12px 16px;
    }
    .hp-receipt-title {
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
        font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 800; color: #1E7A3D;
        text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .05em;
    }
    .hp-receipt-title svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .hp-receipt-ref {
        font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #1FA971;
        background: #fff; border: 1px solid #BFE8CF;
        padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 999px;
        font-family: 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace;
        white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .hp-receipt-body { padding: 4px 16px 12px; }
    .hp-receipt-row {
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 12px; padding: 9px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px dashed #EEF1F6;
        font-size: 13px;
    }
    .hp-receipt-row:last-of-type { border-bottom: 0; }
    .hp-receipt-row .k {
        color: var(--rh-muted); font-weight: 700; font-size: 11px;
        text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em;
    }
    .hp-receipt-row .v { color: var(--rh-ink); font-weight: 700; }
    .hp-receipt-row .v.money { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: #1E7A3D; }
    .hp-receipt-total {
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 12px; margin-top: 6px; padding: 12px 0 2px;
        border-top: 2px solid #EEF1F6;
    }
    .hp-receipt-total .k {
        font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--rh-muted);
        text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .05em;
    }
    .hp-receipt-total .v { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--rh-ink); }
    .hp-receipt-note { margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--rh-muted); }

    /* ---- "Manage Payout Methods" header link ---- */
    .hp-link-view-all {
        font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #b07708;
        text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .hp-link-view-all:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    /* ---- Request form (legacy hp-form-* / hp-input / hp-select) ---- */
    .hp-form-grid {
        display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px;
    }
    .hp-field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; min-width: 0; }
    .hp-field label {
        font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--rh-muted);
        text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em;
    }
    .hp-input,
    .hp-select {
        width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;
        padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 9px;
        border: 1px solid #dfe4ea; background: #fff;
        font-family: inherit; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--rh-ink); outline: none;
        transition: border-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
    }
    .hp-input:focus,
    .hp-select:focus {
        border-color: var(--rh-accent);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.18);
    }

    .hp-form-actions {
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-top: 16px;
    }
    .hp-btn-primary {
        display: inline-block; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 9px;
        border: 1px solid var(--rh-accent);
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f6b93b, #eda423);
        color: #1c2a38; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;
        font-family: inherit; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.35);
        transition: background 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
    }
    .hp-btn-primary:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.45);
    }

    /* ---- History table (legacy hp-table values) ---- */
    .hp-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; }
    .hp-table th {
        text-align: left; padding: 10px 12px;
        font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--rh-muted);
        text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .03em;
        border-bottom: 2px solid #EEF1F6; white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .hp-table td {
        padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #F6F7FB;
        color: var(--rh-ink); vertical-align: top;
    }
    .hp-amount { font-weight: 800; white-space: nowrap; }

    /* ---- Status pills (legacy hp-status-*) ---- */
    .hp-status { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; white-space: nowrap; }
    .hp-status-active   { background: #E7F7EC; color: #1fa971; }
    .hp-status-pending  { background: var(--rh-accent-light); color: #b07708; }
    .hp-status-rejected { background: #FCEAEA; color: #e14b4b; }
    .hp-status-unlisted { background: #F0F1F6; color: var(--rh-muted); }

    /* ---- Empty state ---- */
    .hp-empty-state {
        text-align: center; padding: 56px 20px;
        background: #fff; border: 1px dashed var(--rh-line);
        border-radius: var(--rh-radius);
        font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--rh-muted);
    }
    .hp-empty-state p { margin: 0; }
    .hp-empty-state-title {
        font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--rh-ink); margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    /* ---- Icon baseline ---- */
    svg.icon { display: inline-block; vertical-align: -0.18em; flex-shrink: 0; }

    /* ---- Dark mode ---- */
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-page-title { color: #e8ecf1; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-stat-pill-item { background: #141b24; border-color: #1a222b; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-stat-pill-label { color: #8d99a5; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-stat-pill-value { color: #e8ecf1; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-stat-pill-icon { background: #1a222b; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-input,
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-select { background: #141b24; border-color: #2a3540; color: #e8ecf1; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-field label { color: #8d99a5; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-btn-primary { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f6b93b, #eda423); border-color: #eda423; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-link-view-all { color: #f6c04e; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-table th { color: #8d99a5; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-table td { color: #e8ecf1; border-bottom-color: #1a222b; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-status-active   { background: rgba(47, 190, 125, 0.15); color: #4ade80; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-status-pending  { background: rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.15); color: #f6c04e; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-status-rejected { background: rgba(226, 74, 61, 0.15); color: #f28b82; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-status-unlisted { background: #1a222b; color: #8d99a5; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-empty-state { background: #141b24; border-color: #1a222b; color: #8d99a5; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-empty-state-title { color: #e8ecf1; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-receipt { background: #141b24; border-color: rgba(47, 190, 125, 0.35); }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-receipt-top { background: rgba(47, 190, 125, 0.12); border-bottom-color: rgba(47, 190, 125, 0.3); }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-receipt-title { color: #4ade80; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-receipt-ref { background: #1a222b; border-color: rgba(47, 190, 125, 0.35); color: #4ade80; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-receipt-row { border-bottom-color: #1a222b; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-receipt-row .k { color: #8d99a5; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-receipt-row .v { color: #e8ecf1; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-receipt-row .v.money { color: #4ade80; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-receipt-total { border-top-color: #1a222b; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-receipt-total .k { color: #8d99a5; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-receipt-total .v { color: #e8ecf1; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-receipt-note { color: #8d99a5; }
</style>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<div class="hp-page-header">
    <div>
        <h1 class="hp-page-title">Payouts</h1>
        <p class="hp-page-subtitle">Withdraw your earnings to your payout method.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="hp-stat-pillbox">
        <div class="hp-stat-pill-item">
            <div class="hp-stat-pill-icon">
                {{ ui.icon('wallet') }}
            </div>
            <div>
                <p class="hp-stat-pill-label">Available</p>
                <p class="hp-stat-pill-value">₱ {{ available|number_format(2, '.', ',') }}</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hp-stat-pill-item">
            <div class="hp-stat-pill-icon hp-yellow">
                {{ ui.icon('clock') }}
            </div>
            <div>
                <p class="hp-stat-pill-label">Pending</p>
                <p class="hp-stat-pill-value">₱ {{ pending_out|number_format(2, '.', ',') }}</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hp-stat-pill-item">
            <div class="hp-stat-pill-icon hp-green">
                {{ ui.icon('banknote') }}
            </div>
            <div>
                <p class="hp-stat-pill-label">Paid Out</p>
                <p class="hp-stat-pill-value">₱ {{ paid_out|number_format(2, '.', ',') }}</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

{% if session_flash %}
    <div class="hp-flash {{ session_flash.type == 'success' ? 'hp-flash-success' : 'hp-flash-error' }}">
        {{ session_flash.message }}
    </div>
{% endif %}

{% if payout_receipt %}
<!-- RECEIPT — one render after the successful instant payout -->
<section class="hp-receipt">
    <div class="hp-receipt-top">
        <span class="hp-receipt-title">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
            Payout Successful
        </span>
        <span class="hp-receipt-ref">{{ payout_receipt.reference }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hp-receipt-body">
        <div class="hp-receipt-row">
            <span class="k">Amount Paid Out</span>
            <span class="v money">₱ {{ payout_receipt.amount|number_format(2, '.', ',') }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hp-receipt-row">
            <span class="k">Payout Method</span>
            <span class="v">{{ payout_receipt.method }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hp-receipt-row">
            <span class="k">Processed</span>
            <span class="v">{{ payout_receipt.date }} &middot; {{ payout_receipt.time }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hp-receipt-row">
            <span class="k">Status</span>
            <span class="v"><span class="hp-status hp-status-active">Completed</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="hp-receipt-total">
            <span class="k">New Available Balance</span>
            <span class="v">₱ {{ payout_receipt.new_available|number_format(2, '.', ',') }}</span>
        </div>
        <p class="hp-receipt-note">The money is gone from your Available balance and the payout is recorded in your history below.</p>
    </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<!-- Request payout -->
<section class="hp-card">
    <div class="hp-card-header">
        <h3>Request a Payout</h3>
        <a href="/host/payout-methods" class="hp-link-view-all">Manage Payout Methods</a>
    </div>
    <form method="POST" action="{{ path('app_host_payouts') }}">
        <input type="hidden" name="pay_csrf" value="{{ pay_csrf }}">
        <div class="hp-form-grid">
            <div class="hp-field">
                <label for="amount">Amount (₱)</label>
                <input class="hp-input" type="number" name="amount" id="amount"
                    min="500" max="{{ available|round(0, 'floor') }}" step="0.01"
                    value="{{ available|round(0, 'floor') }}" required>
            </div>
            <div class="hp-field">
                <label for="method">Payout Method</label>
                <select class="hp-select" name="method" id="method">
                    <option>GCash</option>
                    <option>PayMaya</option>
                    <option>Bank Transfer</option>
                </select>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hp-form-actions">
            <button type="submit" name="request_payout" value="1" class="hp-btn-primary">REQUEST PAYOUT</button>
            <span class="hp-muted" style="align-self:center;">Minimum ₱500 &middot; processed within 1&ndash;3 business days</span>
        </div>
    </form>
</section>

<!-- History -->
<section class="hp-card">
    <div class="hp-card-header">
        <h3>Payout History</h3>
    </div>

    {% if not payout_table_exists %}
        <div class="hp-empty-state">
            <p class="hp-empty-state-title">Payouts table not created yet</p>
            <p>Run the CREATE TABLE SQL in phpMyAdmin first.</p>
        </div>
    {% elseif payouts is empty %}
        <div class="hp-empty-state">
            <p class="hp-empty-state-title">No payouts yet</p>
            <p>Your payout requests and their status will show up here.</p>
        </div>
    {% else %}
        <table class="hp-table">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Requested</th>
                    <th>Method</th>
                    <th>Status</th>
                    <th style="text-align:right;">Amount</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {% for p in payouts %}
                    <tr>
                        <td>{{ p.requested }}</td>
                        <td>{{ p.method }}</td>
                        <td><span class="hp-status {{ p.status_class }}">{{ p.status_label }}</span></td>
                        <td class="hp-amount" style="text-align:right;">₱ {{ p.amount|number_format(2, '.', ',') }}</td>
                    </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>
    {% endif %}
</section>
{% endblock %}
